# LIVE customer-facing 500 — certificate ask page

**This is live and customer-facing. Real subscribers clicking the certificate link in email 7 are getting a 500.** Treat as urgent.

## The failing request

Joel clicked the certificate CTA from Kit broadcast "You finished. Here's your certificate." and got **HTTP 500**.

Route: `/ask/ai-hero-skills-workflow-certificate` with `answer=other`.

Decoded `pt` token payload (do NOT reuse this token to reproduce — see constraints):

```json
{
  "contactId": "surdw",
  "valuePathResourceId": "ai-hero-skills-workflow",
  "emailResourceId": "ai-hero-skills-workflow.email-7",
  "sequenceId": "ai-hero-skills-workflow",
